MODULE: DedupRecordsDroppedEntry
TARGET: DedupSound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a lost entry's identity is recorded as applied, so its re-ship is deduplicated away
PERTURBS: Drop

--- FIND
    /\ inflight' = inflight \ {m}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<aStore, bStore, applied, hwm, wal, journal, walFloor, clock>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ inflight' = inflight \ {m}
    /\ applied' = applied \cup {IdOf(m)}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<aStore, bStore, hwm, wal, journal, walFloor, clock>>
--- END
